"XMP 附属文件的结构不受支持（不是可识别的 RDF/XMP 文档）。请确认该 .xmp 文件内容，或替换为标准 XMP 文档后重试。" = "The XMP sidecar file has an unsupported structure (not a recognizable RDF/XMP document). Check the contents of the .xmp file, or replace it with a standard XMP document and try again.";
