"备份文件不在照片的 XMP 所在目录，Gather 已拒绝操作。请把备份移回该目录后再试。" = "The backup is not in the same folder as the photo's XMP, so Gather refused to touch it. Move it back into that folder and retry.";
"备份文件名不符合 Gather 的受控命名（应为照片的 XMP 文件名加 .gather-backup- 前缀）。请把备份改回该命名后再试。" = "The backup name does not match Gather's controlled name (the photo's XMP file name plus a .gather-backup- prefix). Rename it to that form and retry.";
"备份是符号链接，Gather 不会跟随链接操作。请把链接替换为真实的备份文件后再试。" = "The backup is a symbolic link; Gather does not follow links. Replace it with the real backup file and retry.";
