"备份路径未通过安全校验，Gather 不会操作任何文件。请检查照片旁的 .xmp 与 .gather-backup-* 文件后再试。" = "The backup path failed the safety check, so Gather will not touch any file. Check the .xmp and .gather-backup-* files next to the photo, then retry.";
"清理已停止：该交付的备份路径未通过安全校验，Gather 没有恢复或删除任何文件。仅重试不会自愈；请先把备份修复为受控命名并放回照片目录，再重试清理。若无法修复，请保留现场并联系支持。" = "Cleanup stopped: this delivery's backup path failed the safety check, so Gather did not restore or delete any file. Retrying alone will not fix it. Repair the backup to its controlled name in the photo folder, then retry cleanup. If you cannot repair it, keep the files and contact support.";
"结束同步已停止：该交付的备份路径未通过安全校验，Gather 保留了交付记录与备份文件。仅重试不会自愈；请先把备份修复为受控命名并放回照片目录，再重试结束同步。若无法修复，请保留现场并联系支持。" = "Finishing sync stopped: this delivery's backup path failed the safety check, so Gather kept the delivery record and the backup file. Retrying alone will not fix it. Repair the backup to its controlled name in the photo folder, then retry. If you cannot repair it, keep the files and contact support.";
"结束同步已停止：该交付仍有未完成的 XMP 项目。请先在对应模块完成写回或处理冲突，再重试结束同步；重试不会跳过这些项目。" = "Finishing sync stopped: this delivery still has unfinished XMP items. Finish the writeback or resolve conflicts in the owning module first, then retry. Retrying will not skip these items.";
